<div class="site-page">
  <h2>Our Goal</h2>
  <p>Research Roomies is a simple coordination tool designed to help academics reduce conference travel costs by connecting attendees who wish to share hotel rooms, rental cars, or other expenses. Our platform facilitates introductions between users, but does not participate in or monitor any arrangements made outside the site.</p>
  <p><a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a></p>
  <p><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></p>
  
  <h2 style="margin-top: 1.5rem">Safety Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>Research Roomies does not verify, screen, or endorse the identity, background, or intent of any user, nor do we review the accuracy of user-provided information. We are not responsible for mediating disputes or monitoring off-site communication. Users are solely responsible for verifying the identity and suitability of anyone they connect with and should use caution when arranging shared lodging or transportation.</p>
  
