  <h2 style="margin-top: 1.5rem">Partnerships</h2>
  <p>We welcome academic organizations and conference committees to share Research Roomies in their announcements. If you contact us at <a href="mailto:admin@researchroomies.com">admin@researchroomies.com</a> beforehand, we may be able to feature your conference on our site to make coordination easier for your attendees. Sharing or featuring does not constitute an endorsement.</p>

